			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Align DTO serialization to camelCase and fix SCM provider field mapping\n\nThis commit standardizes JSON serialization across all DTO structs from PascalCase to camelCase to match the wire format expected by Wind/Sky. Additionally fixes the SCM provider registration which was silently failing due to field name mismatches.\n\n**DTO Serialization Migration (13 files)**\n- Change `#[serde(rename_all = \"PascalCase\")]` to `#[serde(rename_all = \"camelCase\")]` across CustomDocumentStateDTO, DocumentStateDTO, MarkerDataDTO, MergedConfigurationStateDTO, OutputChannelStateDTO, ProviderRegistrationDTO, RPCModelContentChangeDTO, RPCRangeDTO, WebviewStateDTO, WindowStateDTO, WorkspaceFolderStateDTO\n- Add explicit `#[serde(rename = \"uri\")]` for URL fields and `#[serde(rename = \"eol\")]` for EOL field\n\n**SCM Provider Fixes (2 files)**\n- RegisterScmProvider: Change PascalCase keys (\"ID\", \"Label\", \"RootUri\") to camelCase (\"id\", \"label\", \"rootUri\") to match SourceControlCreateDTO's wire shape\n- RegisterScmResourceGroup: Add missing \"providerHandle\" field and use camelCase keys (\"providerHandle\", \"groupId\", \"label\") matching SourceControlGroupUpdateDTO\n\n**Code Cleanup**\n- Add #[allow(dead_code)] to 15 structs/functions used only in specific build configs\n- Make 7 structs public (WatcherEntry, TestControllerState, TestRunStatus, TestResult, TestRun, ConnectionHealthChecker, EncryptionKey) for testing\n- Change result-discarding calls from `Self::Method(...)` to `let _ = Self::Method(...)` for clarity\n- Remove unused IPC handlers: file:readFile/writeFile/rename/watch/unwatch, workspaces:getWorkspaceIdentifier/enterWorkspace\n- Set MACOSX_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET=10.13 in Cargo config for broader compatibility",
			"SHA": "11b3c822ee8a556e47c07a9821fdc8f028c8bad4"
		}
